<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BridgeX V12｜AI 驅動商業媒合與交易平台</title>
<meta name="description" content="BridgeX｜讓需求找到供給，讓供給找到市場。AI 驅動的商業媒合、商機驗證、商務案件、交易與跨境落地平台。">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#07111f;--bg2:#0b1728;--panel:#0f1d31;--panel2:#12243b;
  --line:#203550;--text:#eef5ff;--muted:#9fb1c8;--accent:#66d9ff;
  --accent2:#9b8cff;--green:#55e6a5;--orange:#ffbf69;--danger:#ff7f8c;
  --max:1240px;--radius:22px;--shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25)
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:Inter,"Noto Sans TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#06101d 0%,#091525 55%,#07111f 100%);color:var(--text);line-height:1.7}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button{font:inherit}
.container{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(7,17,31,.86);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
.nav{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px}.logo span{color:var(--accent)}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:#cbd7e8}
.navlinks a:hover{color:#fff}
.btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#10233a;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer;transition:.2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:#4a6687}
.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#48cfff,#8c7dff);border:0;color:#04101d;font-weight:800}
.hero{padding:92px 0 70px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(83,194,255,.10);filter:blur(80px);right:-220px;top:-220px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;padding:6px 11px;border:1px solid #2b4968;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:18px;background:rgba(20,42,65,.55)}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,76px);line-height:1.08;max-width:950px;letter-spacing:-2px}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--accent)}
.lead{font-size:19px;color:#b9c9dc;max-width:820px;margin:25px 0}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-flow{margin-top:48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:8px}
.flow-item{padding:14px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(15,29,49,.85);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;font-size:13px;color:#dce8f6}
.flow-item strong{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px;margin-bottom:2px}
section{padding:78px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.045)}
.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:30px}
.kicker{color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.5px}
h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;margin-top:7px}
.section-desc{max-width:560px;color:var(--muted)}
.grid{display:grid;gap:18px}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(18,36,59,.92),rgba(10,23,39,.92));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:25px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:9px}.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
.num{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:13px}
.pain .card{min-height:180px}
.quote{font-size:26px;line-height:1.45;padding:34px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);background:rgba(14,31,51,.7);border-radius:0 18px 18px 0}
.big-flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.big-flow .node{flex:1 1 135px;min-height:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:14px;font-weight:700}
.big-flow .arrow{color:var(--accent);font-size:22px}
.role-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden}.role-card .icon{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ai-box{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(49,104,142,.35),rgba(61,51,131,.3));border:1px solid #365b7d;border-radius:26px;padding:32px}
.ai-process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:22px}
.ai-process div{padding:17px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(5,17,30,.55);border:1px solid #2b4968;text-align:center}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;background:#17324c;color:#bcecff;margin-bottom:10px}
.lead-demo{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:18px}
.score{font-size:54px;font-weight:900;color:var(--green);line-height:1}
.metric{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #203550;color:#b8c9dc}
.metric strong{color:#fff}
.revenue{position:relative}.revenue .price{font-size:14px;color:var(--green);margin-top:16px;font-weight:800}
.revenue:nth-child(2) .price{color:var(--accent)}.revenue:nth-child(3) .price{color:var(--orange)}.revenue:nth-child(4) .price{color:var(--accent2)}
.funnel{display:grid;gap:8px;max-width:850px;margin:25px auto}
.funnel div{text-align:center;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin:auto;background:var(--panel)}
.funnel div:nth-child(1){width:100%}.funnel div:nth-child(2){width:90%}.funnel div:nth-child(3){width:78%}.funnel div:nth-child(4){width:66%}.funnel div:nth-child(5){width:54%}.funnel div:nth-child(6){width:43%}.funnel div:nth-child(7){width:32%}
.supply{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}.pill{padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0e2034;border-radius:999px;color:#d4e1ef}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:760px;background:var(--panel)}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
th{color:var(--accent);background:#11243a}td{color:#c5d2e2}
.timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.timeline .phase{border-top:3px solid var(--accent);padding-top:18px}
.phase h3{font-size:22px}.phase ul{padding-left:19px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}
.coop{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#102a3f,#17183a);border:1px solid #315476;border-radius:26px;padding:35px}
.coop-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:25px}
.coop-flow div{padding:14px 6px;text-align:center;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(4,14,25,.45);border:1px solid #2d4b68;font-size:13px}
.footer{padding:55px 0 70px;color:#8194aa;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
.footer strong{color:#fff}
.modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.72);z-index:200;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.modal.active{display:flex}.modal-box{width:min(720px,100%);max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;background:#0b1829;border:1px solid #31506e;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.close{float:right;border:0;background:transparent;color:#9eb0c4;font-size:25px;cursor:pointer}
input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;background:#081525;color:#fff;border:1px solid #29445f;border-radius:10px;margin:7px 0 14px}
label{font-size:13px;color:#a9bad0}
.notice{padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:#10283b;border:1px solid #2d536f;color:#c7d9ea}
.checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}.check{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#0d1e31}
.center{text-align:center}.muted{color:var(--muted)}
@media(max-width:1024px){
  .navlinks a:nth-child(n+5){display:none}.hero-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  .grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.ai-process{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .coop-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
}
@media(max-width:768px){
  .container{width:min(100% - 28px,var(--max))}.nav{height:64px}.navlinks{display:none}
  .hero{padding:65px 0 45px}.lead{font-size:17px}
  section{padding:58px 0}.section-head{display:block}.section-desc{margin-top:12px}
  .grid-2,.grid-3,.grid-4,.lead-demo,.timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .ai-process{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .big-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr}.big-flow .arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);text-align:center}
  .coop-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .funnel div{width:100%!important}
  .quote{font-size:21px}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  h1{font-size:40px;letter-spacing:-1px}.hero-actions .btn{width:100%}
  .hero-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.checks{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .card{padding:20px}.coop{padding:23px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}.btn{transition:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="container nav">
    <a class="logo" href="#top">Bridge<span>X</span></a>
    <nav class="navlinks">
      <a href="#market">市場</a><a href="#core">BridgeX</a><a href="#ai">AI 商機引擎</a>
      <a href="#supply">供給市場</a><a href="#demand">需求市場</a><a href="#business">商業模式</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="btn primary" onclick="openModal('demandModal')">提出商業需求</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">AI 驅動的商業媒合 × 商機 × 交易 × 落地</div>
    <h1>讓需求找到供給，<br><span>讓供給找到市場。</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">BridgeX 把 AI、遊戲、數位產品、社群與媒體、服務與商業需求，連成一條可交易的商業鏈。從需求發現、AI 分析、驗證與媒合，到成交、落地與跨境交易，讓供給與需求真正轉化為商業機會。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <button class="btn primary" onclick="openModal('demandModal')">我有一個需求</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="openModal('supplyModal')">我要提供產品／服務</button>
      <a class="btn" href="#ai">30 秒看懂 BridgeX</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-flow">
      <div class="flow-item"><strong>01</strong>需求</div><div class="flow-item"><strong>02</strong>AI 分析</div>
      <div class="flow-item"><strong>03</strong>驗證</div><div class="flow-item"><strong>04</strong>媒合</div>
      <div class="flow-item"><strong>05</strong>高品質商機</div><div class="flow-item"><strong>06</strong>商務案件</div>
      <div class="flow-item"><strong>07</strong>成交落地</div><div class="flow-item"><strong>08</strong>數據優化</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="market">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">01 / MARKET SHIFT</div><h2>市場正在發生什麼變化？</h2></div><p class="section-desc">網際網路改變的是資訊流動；AI 正在進一步改變需求被理解、被匹配、被執行與被交易的方式。</p></div>
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="card"><div class="num">2000｜網際網路浪口</div><h3>資訊開始線上流動</h3><p>搜尋、網站、電商、社群讓人第一次可以低成本取得大量資訊與商品。</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="num">2026｜AI 浪口</div><h3>需求開始被 AI 理解</h3><p>使用者不只搜尋關鍵字，而是可以直接描述問題，由 AI 協助分析需求、找到產品、找到人、找到市場與合作方式。</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="quote" style="margin-top:22px">真正的新機會，不只是「更多 AI 工具」，而是讓 AI 介入商業需求從產生到成交的整個過程。</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="pain">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">02 / PROBLEM</div><h2>為什麼現在的商業媒合效率仍然不高？</h2></div><p class="section-desc">資訊很多，但真正能形成商業連結、完成驗證、推進交易的資訊仍然分散。</p></div>
  <div class="grid grid-4">
    <div class="card"><div class="num">01</div><h3>找不到對的人</h3><p>Google、社群、朋友介紹、展會、代理商各自分散，搜尋成本高。</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="num">02</div><h3>需求沒有被結構化</h3><p>很多人知道自己有問題，卻不知道如何精準描述需求與合作條件。</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="num">03</div><h3>找到之後還要自己驗證</h3><p>產品是否適合、預算是否合理、對方是否真的有能力，都需要人工確認。</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="num">04</div><h3>媒合後仍停在聊天</h3><p>很多平台完成「介紹」就結束，報價、合約、跨境與落地仍由雙方自行處理。</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="core">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">03 / WHAT IS BRIDGEX</div><h2>BridgeX 的本質</h2></div><p class="section-desc">不是單純的 AI 工具站、產品資料庫或接案平台，而是一個 AI 驅動的商業轉換平台。</p></div>
  <div class="big-flow">
    <div class="node">需求</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">AI 理解</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">高品質商機</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">商務案件</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">交易與落地</div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-top:25px">
    <div class="card role-card"><div class="icon">🙋</div><h3>需求方</h3><p>個人、小團隊、新創、企業、組織，只要有需要解決的商業問題都可以進入。</p></div>
    <div class="card role-card"><div class="icon">🧩</div><h3>供給方</h3><p>擁有產品、服務、技術、內容、流量、通路或市場能力的人與團隊。</p></div>
    <div class="card role-card"><div class="icon">🤖</div><h3>BridgeX</h3><p>用 AI 分析需求、整理條件、尋找適合供給，並把機會轉化為可推進的商務案件。</p></div>
    <div class="card role-card"><div class="icon">🌏</div><h3>執行夥伴</h3><p>協助 BD、行銷、代理、出版、在地化、支付、跨境與實際落地。</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="ai">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">04 / AI ENGINE</div><h2>AI 不只是聊天，而是商業引擎</h2></div><p class="section-desc">BridgeX 將自然語言需求轉成可以被搜尋、比較、驗證與交易的商業條件。</p></div>
  <div class="ai-box">
    <span class="badge">AI 智能分析</span>
    <h3 style="font-size:27px">「我想找一個能幫我打進馬來西亞市場的遊戲發行商」</h3>
    <div class="ai-process">
      <div>需求類型<br><strong>市場拓展</strong></div>
      <div>產品類型<br><strong>遊戲</strong></div>
      <div>市場<br><strong>馬來西亞</strong></div>
      <div>合作模式<br><strong>發行／代理</strong></div>
      <div>時程／預算<br><strong>待確認</strong></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:18px">AI 再進一步判斷：需要什麼能力？哪些供給方符合？哪些條件需要人工驗證？哪些機會值得進入商務流程？</p>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">05 / QUALIFIED LEAD</div><h2>AI 高品質商機引擎</h2></div><p class="section-desc">不是每一個需求都值得付費。BridgeX 的價值在於把「需求」轉化成具備商業條件的高品質商機。</p></div>
  <div class="big-flow">
    <div class="node">提出需求</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">AI 需求分析</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">人工／AI 驗證</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">高品質商機</div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node">供給媒合</div>
  </div>
  <div class="lead-demo" style="margin-top:24px">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="badge">Qualified Lead 範例</span>
      <h3>台灣 AI 企業尋找東南亞行銷合作夥伴</h3>
      <div class="metric"><span>需求是否真實</span><strong>✓ 已驗證</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>需求是否清楚</span><strong>✓ 已結構化</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>預算／商業條件</span><strong>待確認</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>決策權</span><strong>已確認</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>合作時程</span><strong>30–60 天</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card center">
      <div class="num">商機品質指標</div><div class="score">A</div>
      <p style="margin-top:8px">具備明確需求、決策窗口與合作方向，可進入供給媒合與 BD 流程。</p>
      <button class="btn primary" style="margin-top:20px" onclick="openModal('leadModal')">查看商機流程</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">06 / MONETIZATION</div><h2>高品質商機如何變現？</h2></div><p class="section-desc">BridgeX 不必等到最終成交才產生收入；商機本身就是可以被定價的商業資產。</p></div>
  <div class="funnel">
    <div>免費使用／流量</div><div>會員與 AI 服務</div><div>提出商業需求</div><div>高品質商機</div><div>商務案件</div><div>成交與落地</div><div>數據與 AI 智能分析</div>
  </div>
  <div class="notice center">核心邏輯：<strong>Free → 商機 → 商務案件 → 交易 → 落地 → 數據</strong></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="supply">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">07 / SUPPLY MARKET</div><h2>BridgeX 連接什麼供給？</h2></div><p class="section-desc">供給不只是一個產品，也可以是一種能力、一個通路、一群使用者或一個市場。</p></div>
  <div class="supply">
    <span class="pill">AI 產品</span><span class="pill">遊戲</span><span class="pill">數位產品</span><span class="pill">SaaS</span>
    <span class="pill">行銷服務</span><span class="pill">技術服務</span><span class="pill">設計與內容</span><span class="pill">顧問服務</span>
    <span class="pill">KOL／創作者</span><span class="pill">社群</span><span class="pill">媒體</span><span class="pill">廣告通路</span>
    <span class="pill">代理商</span><span class="pill">發行商</span><span class="pill">在地合作夥伴</span><span class="pill">跨境服務</span>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="demand">
<div class="container">
